      "source": "If the headers contain neither Content-Length nor Transfer-Encoding,\nand the body is a <code>Mono</code>, count the bytes and set Content-Length.",
      "translation": "如果标头中既不包含 `Content-Length` 也不包含 `Transfer-Encoding`，且体为 `<code>Mono</code>`，则计算字节数并设置 `Content-Length`。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "RFC 7302 allows HTTP HEAD response without content-length and it's not\nsomething that can be computed on a streaming response.",
      "translation": "RFC 7302 允许 HTTP HEAD 响应不包含 content-length，且无法在流式响应中计算该值。",
      "count": 2
    },
